body='<h1>M01-S3 Native selection／Owner 生命週期提案</h1><p>待採納子提案；不是完整 S3 精確包，不是 Skeleton 授權。</p><h2>本輪發現</h2><p>目前已有 main/local origin 授權 guard 及 HostState → AppState lock-order 先例；WORK registry 既有 ownership 不應重建。S2 的非空 authority 字串明確不等於 native 授權。</p><h2>兩個架構視圖</h2><pre>'+html.escape(m['architecture']['hexagonal']+'\n\n'+m['architecture']['dependency'])+'</pre><p>'+html.escape(m['architecture']['ownership'])+'</p><p>'+html.escape(m['architecture']['transaction'])+'</p><h2>精確建議</h2>'
