body+='<h2>生命週期轉移</h2><table>'+''.join('<tr><td>'+html.escape(t['event'])+'</td><td>'+html.escape(t['pre'])+'</td><td>'+html.escape(t['post'])+'</td></tr>' for t in transitions)+'</table><h2>BDD／TDD</h2><p>15 個 caller／owner／picker-race／cancel／reopen／late-commit 規劃 oracle。全部 NOT RUN；本地 origin 通過只代表 caller gate，不代表整個操作已授權。完整 native alias 及新 native seam 仍需精確化，不能以 UI path 或 lexical key 代替。</p><h2>風險與下一步</h2><ul>'+''.join('<li>'+html.escape(x)+'</li>' for x in m['remaining_gates'])+'</ul><p>只修改 M01 planning 與自身看板證據。796 產品來源、branch／HEAD 核對一致；所有產品測試、build、native、RED 均 NOT RUN。M01 PREP 保留黃燈；既有 S1/S2 已驗收成果保留。</p>'
